eadline; verify that date in the current course portal.","tags":["Cambridge","Master's","PhD"],"source":"https://www.student-funding.cam.ac.uk/fund/gates-us-fund-2026","sourceLabel":"University of Cambridge: 2027–2028 Gates US round","checked":"23 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"erasmus-mundus-2027","title":"Erasmus Mundus Joint Masters 2027","provider":"European Union","type":"Scholarship","level":"Master's","country":"Multiple European countries","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"Consortium-specific; check the current programme call","status":"Check official site","summary":"Joint master's programmes use their own calls and scholarship deadlines. The European Commission describes many applications between October and January, but this umbrella record is not a confirmed open call.","tags":["Europe","Joint degree","Mobility"],"source":"https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/individuals/students/erasmus-mundus-joint-masters","sourceLabel":"European Commission – Erasmus+","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"daad-epos-2027","title":"DAAD EPOS Scholarships 2027–2028","provider":"DAAD","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","country":"Germany","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"Varies by selected postgraduate course","status":"Check official site","summary":"Development-related postgraduate funding for graduates from eligible countries, generally requiring at least two years of professional experience.","tags":["Germany","Development","Professional experience"],"source":"https://www2.daad.de/deutschland/stipendium/datenbank/en/21148-scholarship-database/?detail=50076777","sourceLabel":"DAAD scholarship database","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"kaust-2027","title":"KAUST Graduate Admission & Fellowship 2027","provider":"King Abdullah University of Science and Technology","type":"Graduate Program","level":"Graduate","country":"Saudi Arabia","region":"Middle East","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"Fall 2027: 3 January 2027","deadlineDate":"2027-01-03","status":"Open","summary":"Fall 2027 applications are open for MS, MS/PhD and PhD study with KAUST Fellowship support for admitted graduate students.","tags":["STEM","MS","PhD"],"source":"https://admissions.kaust.edu.sa/how-to-apply/admission-timelines","sourceLabel":"KAUST Admissions","checked":"23 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"mext-2027","title":"Japanese Government MEXT Scholarships","provider":"Government of Japan","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Japan","region":"Asia","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"Varies by embassy or university route","status":"Check official site","summary":"Japanese government scholarships for international students selected through embassy, university or authority recommendation routes.","tags":["Japan","Embassy route","University route"],"source":"https://www.mext.go.jp/en/policy/education/highered/title02/detail02/sdetail02/1373897.htm","sourceLabel":"MEXT official website","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"australia-awards-scholarships","title":"Australia Awards Scholarships","provider":"Australian Government Department of Foreign Affairs and Trade","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Australia","region":"Oceania","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"Country-specific; check the participating-country profile","status":"Check official site","summary":"Long-term undergraduate and postgraduate awards for eligible developing-country applicants, with benefits generally including tuition, travel, living support and health cover.","tags":["Developing countries","Government scholarship","Return-home condition"],"source":"https://www.dfat.gov.au/people-to-people/australia-awards/australia-awards-scholarships","sourceLabel":"Australian Government DFAT","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"unicef-internships","title":"UNICEF Internship Programme","provider":"UNICEF","type":"Internship","level":"Student","country":"Multiple countries","region":"Global","funding":"Paid","deadline":"Vacancy-specific","status":"Rolling","summary":"Hands-on global internship opportunities for students and recent graduates from diverse academic backgrounds.","tags":["United Nations","Students","Recent graduates"],"source":"https://www.unicef.org/careers/internships","sourceLabel":"UNICEF Careers","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"oecd-internship","title":"OECD Internship Programme","provider":"OECD","type":"Internship","level":"Student","country":"France / Remote","region":"Global","funding":"Paid","deadline":"Applications accepted throughout the year","status":"Rolling","summary":"Policy-focused internships for students who remain enrolled in an accredited degree programme for the internship duration.","tags":["Policy","Hybrid","Remote possible"],"source":"https://www.oecd.org/en/about/careers/internships.html","sourceLabel":"OECD Careers","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"humphrey-fellowship","title":"Hubert H. Humphrey Fellowship Program","provider":"U.S. Department of State","type":"Fellowship","level":"Graduate","country":"United States","region":"North America","funding":"Funded","deadline":"Varies by U.S. embassy or Fulbright commission","status":"Check official site","summary":"A ten-month non-degree professional enrichment programme for eligible mid-career leaders with a public-service commitment.","tags":["Mid-career","Professional development","Public service"],"source":"https://www.humphreyfellowship.org/how-to-apply/","sourceLabel":"Humphrey Fellowship official website","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"un-young-professionals","title":"United Nations Young Professionals Programme","provider":"United Nations","type":"Entry-Level","level":"Graduate","country":"Multiple duty stations","region":"Global","funding":"Paid","deadline":"Annual exam cycle; participating countries vary","status":"Check official site","summary":"A competitive examination and recruitment initiative for qualified nationals of participating countries to begin a UN professional career.","tags":["International civil service","Competitive exam","Early career"],"source":"https://careers.un.org/young-professionals-programme","sourceLabel":"UN Careers","checked":"2 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"cern-origin","title":"CERN Origin Programme for University Graduates","provider":"CERN","type":"Graduate Program","level":"Graduate","country":"Switzerland","region":"Europe","funding":"Paid","deadline":"Position-specific","status":"Rolling","summary":"Entry-level scientific, technical and administrative roles for recent graduates. Current nationality ceilings apply to some countries, including Pakistan.","tags":["Early graduate","STEM","Administration"],"source":"https://careers.cern/programmes/entry-level-university-graduates/","sourceLabel":"CERN Careers","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"padua-international-excellence-2026-27","title":"Padua International Excellence Scholarship","provider":"University of Padua","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"2027–2028 award terms: verify on the official scholarship page","status":"Check official site","summary":"The 2026–2027 scheme offered €8,000 gross per year plus a tuition-fee exemption for selected international students in eligible English-taught degrees.","tags":["Padua","Merit","English-taught degree"],"source":"https://www.unipd.it/en/padua-international-excellence-scholarship-programme","sourceLabel":"University of Padua","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"polimi-merit-scholarships-2027-28","title":"Politecnico di Milano International Merit Scholarships","provider":"Politecnico di Milano","type":"Scholarship","level":"Master's","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"15 December 2026, noon Italian time; early admission paymen