unded","deadline":"20 October 2026, 16:00 BST","deadlineDate":"2026-10-20","status":"Closed","summary":"The published central 2027–2028 deadline of 20 October 2026 at 16:00 BST has passed. Existing applicants should retain confirmations and follow CSC and nominator instructions; check the official portal for any amendment.","tags":["Commonwealth","Research","PhD"],"source":"https://cscuk.fcdo.gov.uk/scholarships/commonwealth-phd-scholarships-for-least-developed-countries-and-vulnerable-states/","sourceLabel":"Commonwealth Scholarship Commission","checked":"23 October 2026","featured":false,"deadlineAt":"2026-10-20T16:00:00+01:00"},"$24:props:children:1:props:items:2","$24:props:children:1:props:items:3","$24:props:children:1:props:items:4","$24:props:children:1:props:items:5",{"id":"fulbright-foreign-student","title":"Fulbright Foreign Student Program","provider":"U.S. Department of State","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","country":"United States","region":"North America","funding":"Funded","deadline":"Varies by home country","status":"Check official site","summary":"Approximately 4,000 annual grants for foreign graduate students, young professionals and artists; local rules vary by country.","tags":["USA","Master's","Research"],"source":"https://foreign.fulbrightonline.org/apply","sourceLabel":"Foreign Fulbright Program","checked":"13 October 2026"},{"id":"stipendium-hungaricum","title":"Stipendium Hungaricum Scholarship","provider":"Government of Hungary","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Hungary","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"2027–2028 call not confirmed on the official apply page checked 13 October","status":"Check official site","summary":"The official apply page still describes 2026–2027 and its past 15 January 2026 deadline. Prepare by sending-partner route; do not reuse that date for an unannounced future cycle.","tags":["Hungary","Bachelor's","Master's","PhD"],"source":"https://stipendiumhungaricum.hu/apply/","so