-related allowances.","tags":["Research degree","University application","Tuition and stipend"],"source":"https://www.education.gov.au/research-block-grants/research-training-program","sourceLabel":"Australian Government Department of Education","checked":"13 October 2026"},"$24:props:children:1:props:items:7",{"id":"cern-short-term","title":"CERN Short-Term Internship","provider":"CERN","type":"Internship","level":"Student","country":"Switzerland","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"Live position and nationality restrictions apply","status":"Check official site","summary":"Student internships use live positions and enrolment conditions. The official page currently excludes several nationalities, including Pakistani nationals, because an associate-membership ceiling has been reached.","tags":["STEM","Europe","1–6 months"],"source":"https://careers.cern/programmes/short-term-internship/","sourceLabel":"CERN Careers","checked":"23 October 2026"},{"id":"cern-summer","title":"CERN Summer Studentship","provider":"CERN","type":"Internship","level":"Student","country":"Switzerland","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"Annual cycle; check programme page","status":"Check official site","summary":"Scientific and technical project work, expert lectures and an international research experience for eligible university students.","tags":["Summer","Physics","Engineering","Computing"],"source":"https://careers.cern/programmes/summer-studentship/","sourceLabel":"CERN Careers","checked":"13 October 2026"},"$24:props:children:1:props:items:8",{"id":"un-internships","title":"United Nations Internships","provider":"United Nations","type":"Internship","level":"Student","country":"Multiple countries","region":"Global","funding":"Varies","deadline":"Vacancy-specific","status":"Rolling","summary":"Internship openings across UN duty stations and functions for students and recent graduates; conditions vary by vacancy.","tags":["United Nations","Global","Multiple fields"],"source":"https://careers.un.org/","sourceLabel":"UN Careers","checked":"2 October 2026"},{"id":"oecd-young-associates","title":"OECD Young Associates Programme","provider":"OECD","type":"Graduate Program","level":"Graduate","country":"France","region":"Europe","funding":"Paid","deadline":"Cohort-specific","status":"Check official site","summary":"A two-year early-career programme for recent undergraduates interested in policy making, research and analysis.","tags":["Early career","Policy","Two years"],"source":"https://www.oecd.org/en/about/careers/young-associates.html","sourceLabel":"OECD Careers","checked":"13 October 2026"},"$24:props:children:1:props:items:9",{"id":"erasmus-study-exchange","title":"Erasmus+ Study Abroad Exchange","provider":"European Union","type":"Exchange","level":"Student","country":"Multiple European countries","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"Set by the participating home institution","status":"Check official site","summary":"Supported study mobility for eligible short-cycle, bachelor's, master's and doctoral students through participating institutions.","tags":["Student mobility","Europe","Institution nomination"],"source":"https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/individuals/students/studying-abroad","sourceLabel":"European Commission – Erasmus+","checked":"13 October 2026"},"$24:props:children:1:props:items:10","$24:props:children:1:props:items:11",{"id":"italy-maeci-2026-27","title":"MAECI Italian Government Grants 2026–2027","provider":"Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"26 March 2026, 14:00 Italian time — closed","deadlineDate":"2026-03-26","status":"Closed","summary":"The current call is closed. MAECI grants use an annual eligible-country list and the official Study in Italy application portal for study carried out in Italy.","tags":["Italian Government","MAECI","Study in Italy"],"source":"https://www.esteri.it/en/servizi-opportunita/opportunita/borse-di-studio/per-cittadini-stranieri/borsestudio_stranieri/","sourceLabel":"Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs","checked":"13 October 2026"},{"id":"italy-ergo-dsu-2026-27","title":"ER.GO Regional Scholarship 2026–2027","provider":"ER.GO Emilia-Romagna","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"24 August 2026, 16:00 — main scholarship deadline closed","deadlineDate":"2026-08-24","status":"Closed","summary":"Regional right-to-study support assessed under ER.GO's economic, enrolment and merit rules, with separate guidance for families holding income or assets abroad.","tags":["DSU","Emilia-Romagna","Income assessed"],"source":"https://www.er-go.it/cosa-fare-per/bandi-di-concorso/leggi-il-bando","sourceLabel":"ER.GO official 2026–2027 call","checked":"13 October 2026"},"$24:props:children:1:props:items:12","$24:props:children:1:props:items:13",{"id":"schwarzman-2028-announced","title":"Schwarzman Scholars 2028–2029 — announced next cycle","provider":"Schwarzman Scholars","type":"Scholarship","level":"Master's","country":"China","region":"Asia","funding":"Fully funded","status":"Opening soon","deadline":"U.S./Global application period: April–September 2027; exact dates to verify","summary":"The official instructions announce the next U.S./Global cycle for April–September 2027, with the programme beginning August 2028. Chinese-citizenship applicants have a different March–May 2027 period. Applications are not open in this record.","tags":["Announced future cycle","Leadership","Different citizenship routes"],"source":"https://www.schwarzmanscholars.org/admissions/application-instructions/","sourceLabel":"Schwarzman official application instructions","checked":"23 October 2026"}]}]]}]
